  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WASH Officer with UNHCR Chad (DRRS23TD02)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of UNHCR. Once the shelter response is established and in process, UNHCR Chad counts on a WASH Officer P3 regular staff, considering the evolution of the Sudanese crisis, and the volume of the influx of refugees. The mission aims to ensure, in the Eastern zone, the establishment, monitoring and coordination of the Water, Sanitation and Hygiene emergency response at entry points and relocation zones.</narrative>
  </description>
